### AU SFB Brain - request collection
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP client (click "Send Request").
### Or open http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs and try the same calls there.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@kb = ../Sample Questions/Knowledge Base

### ───────── Health ─────────
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Stats: documents, searchable chunks, questions, outcomes, latency (last 24h)
GET {{base}}/v1/stats

### ───────── Upload the knowledge base ─────────
POST {{base}}/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="CASA+TD KB.docx"

< {{kb}}/CASA+TD KB.docx
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

deposits
--b--

### Rates sheet (PDF)
POST {{base}}/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="rates-at-a-glance.pdf"

< {{kb}}/rates-at-a-glance_23rdApr'2026 - Copy.pdf
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

rates
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="effective_from"

2026-04-23
--b--

### Only the non-personal sheet of the dummy data, as knowledge
POST {{base}}/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Inbound_Voice_Agent_Dummy_Data.xlsx"

< ../Sample Questions/Inbound_Voice_Agent_Dummy_Data.xlsx
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Account to debit card mapping
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sheets"

Acct Debit card Mapping
--b--

### ───────── Inspect ─────────
GET {{base}}/v1/documents

### One document: versions, ingestion report (replace the id)
GET {{base}}/v1/documents/DOCUMENT_ID

### Exactly how it was chunked
GET {{base}}/v1/documents/DOCUMENT_ID/chunks

### Background jobs
GET {{base}}/v1/jobs

### ───────── Ask ─────────
POST {{base}}/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "What is the annual fee for the Zenith+ credit card?"}

###
POST {{base}}/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "मैं senior citizen हूँ। एक साल की FD पर अभी सबसे अच्छा interest rate कितना है?"}

###
POST {{base}}/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Laksya card ka annual fee kab maaf hota hai?"}

### Personal request -> routed to verification (Phase B)
POST {{base}}/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Mera balance kitna hai?"}

### Search only (what retrieval finds, with dense/keyword/rerank scores)
POST {{base}}/v1/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "senior citizen FD rate 3 years"}

### ───────── Follow-ups in a session ─────────
POST {{base}}/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
POST {{base}}/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "What is the FD interest rate for 2 years?", "session_id": "SESSION_ID"}

###
POST {{base}}/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "And for senior citizens?", "session_id": "SESSION_ID"}

###
GET {{base}}/v1/sessions/SESSION_ID

### ───────── Traces: why an answer came out ─────────
GET {{base}}/v1/traces?limit=20

###
GET {{base}}/v1/traces?outcome=refused

###
GET {{base}}/v1/traces/TRACE_ID

### ───────── Lifecycle ─────────
### Replace content with a new file (new version, atomic swap)
POST {{base}}/v1/documents/DOCUMENT_ID/versions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="CASA+TD KB.docx"

< {{kb}}/CASA+TD KB.docx
--b--

### Disable (instantly out of search) / enable / rename
PATCH {{base}}/v1/documents/DOCUMENT_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Roll back to version 1
POST {{base}}/v1/documents/DOCUMENT_ID/versions/1/activate

### Re-index one document (or POST /v1/reindex for all)
POST {{base}}/v1/documents/DOCUMENT_ID/reindex

### Soft delete (kept for audit) - add ?purge=true to remove permanently
DELETE {{base}}/v1/documents/DOCUMENT_ID

### Evaluation: run from the command line (uv run python -m evals.golden_run / evals.smoke), not over the API

### ───────── Metrics (Prometheus) ─────────
GET {{base}}/metrics

### ───────── Voice (VOICE_ENABLED=true) ─────────
### Active providers and audio format
GET {{base}}/v1/voice/providers

### Text -> speech (returns WAV; headers x-first-audio-ms / x-total-ms)
POST {{base}}/v1/voice/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "एफडी पर सीनियर सिटीजन को आधा प्रतिशत ज़्यादा ब्याज मिलता है।", "language": "hi"}

### Speech -> text (any audio file)
POST {{base}}/v1/voice/stt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="q.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./data/audio/q_hi_fd.wav
--b--

### One full voice turn: audio -> transcript -> answer -> reply audio (base64 WAV) + timings
POST {{base}}/v1/voice/turn
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="q.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./data/audio/q_en_digital.wav
--b--

### Live call: WebSocket ws://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/voice/stream  (use the UI, or `brain voice FILE`)

### ───────── Personal questions (MVP 2): verify, then answer ─────────
### Test customers (dev only)
GET {{base}}/v1/demo/callers

### 1. A call from a registered number (Anjali Sharma). Copy "id" into SESSION below.
POST {{base}}/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"caller_number": "7107420369", "language": "en"}

### 2. A personal question -> a code is sent (auth.simulated_sms shows it in development)
POST {{base}}/v1/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "What is my balance in both accounts?", "session_id": "SESSION"}

### 3. The keypad code -> verified, and the waiting question is answered
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id": "SESSION", "code": "123456"}

### Verification status / send a new code / end verification
GET {{base}}/v1/auth/SESSION

###
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/resend
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id": "SESSION"}

###
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/end
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id": "SESSION"}
